所以我计算了一位在职工会演员的平均年到手收入，结果是两万九千美元

637
00:27:09.820 --> 00:27:10.440
a year.
一年。

638
00:27:10.900 --> 00:27:11.940
If you're lucky.
如果你运气好的话。

639
00:27:12.260 --> 00:27:13.400
If you're lucky.
如果你运气好的话。

640
00:27:13.660 --> 00:27:14.020
Yeah.
没错。

641
00:27:14.400 --> 00:27:15.140
That's right.
确实如此。

642
00:27:15.420 --> 00:27:19.300
Listen, the artist's journey is not one that you do for money.
听着，艺术家的旅程不是为了钱而走的。

643
00:27:19.460 --> 00:27:21.360
You do it because you love to do it.
你做这件事是因为你热爱它。

644
00:27:21.480 --> 00:27:25.640
It's because it's your passion and you feel like you couldn't do anything else, you know?
因为这是你的热情所在，你觉得除了做这个你什么也做不了，你知道吗？

645
00:27:25.860 --> 00:27:30.340
And so you have to have your eyes wide open if you go into work as an artist that you're
所以当你决定以艺术为业时，你必须睁大眼睛，明白你

646
00:27:30.340 --> 00:27:32.500
doing it for the love of the art.
是为了对艺术的热爱而做。

647
00:27:32.800 --> 00:27:36.940
And if you buy Jenna's book, you'll also get to see her early headshots, which are really
如果你买了珍娜的书，你还能看到她早期的头像照，那真的

648
00:27:36.940 --> 00:27:37.500
a delight.
很有趣。

649
00:27:37.720 --> 00:27:42.540
And so many of them I'm wearing overalls for a reason I can't explain.
而且其中很多照片里我都穿着背带裤，原因我解释不清。

650
00:27:43.100 --> 00:27:43.960
That was a thing.
那时候就流行这个。

651
00:27:45.120 --> 00:27:45.720
All right.
好吧。

652
00:27:45.820 --> 00:27:47.240
Let's get back to the episode.
让我们回到这一集。

653
00:27:47.620 --> 00:27:48.400
Moving on.
继续。

654
00:27:48.920 --> 00:27:54.860
Michael and Dwight are peering out of Michael's office and they're looking on as Toby introduces
迈克尔和德怀特正从迈克尔的办公室往外窥视，他们看着托比把

655
00:27:54.860 --> 00:27:55.760
Holly to Stanley.
霍莉介绍给斯坦利。

656
00:27:56.060 --> 00:27:57.140
Michael hates her.
迈克尔讨厌她。

657
00:27:57.540 --> 00:27:58.300
He hates her.
他讨厌她。

658
00:27:58.420 --> 00:27:59.480
Dwight hates her head.
德怀特讨厌她的头。

659
00:27:59.480 --> 00:27:59.940
Yeah.
是啊。

660
00:28:00.380 --> 00:28:01.640
Doesn't like how her head is.
不喜欢她头的样子。

661
00:28:01.920 --> 00:28:03.480
Dwight says it's an odd shape, right?
德怀特说那形状很奇怪，对吧？

662
00:28:03.620 --> 00:28:06.280
And Michael thinks Dwight just says things to agree with him.
而迈克尔认为德怀特只是为了附和他才这么说。

663
00:28:06.580 --> 00:28:08.740
But he does say, all right, fine.
但他确实说了，好吧，行。

664
00:28:08.820 --> 00:28:09.480
Her head is weird.
她的头确实很怪。

665
00:28:11.810 --> 00:28:15.690
And then Michael says we should sell her an elevator pass.
然后迈克尔说我们应该卖给她一张电梯通行证。

666
00:28:15.950 --> 00:28:20.650
And Dwight's like, but our elevator doesn't require hazing.
德怀特说，但我们的电梯不需要搞恶作剧。

667
00:28:21.970 --> 00:28:22.450
Hazing.
恶作剧。

668
00:28:23.070 --> 00:28:26.510
This is going to kick off a whole storyline for Dwight.
这将开启德怀特的一整条故事线。

669
00:28:26.710 --> 00:28:30.170
Dwight is going to really lean into this idea of hazing Holly.
德怀特真的要沉迷于捉弄霍莉这个主意了。

670
00:28:30.170 --> 00:28:30.750
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

671
00:28:31.010 --> 00:28:32.190
Dwight's on a mission now.
德怀特现在有了任务。

672
00:28:32.310 --> 00:28:34.610
You know, he loves having a call to action.
你知道，他喜欢有行动号召的感觉。

673
00:28:35.170 --> 00:28:39.410
Meanwhile, Phyllis is trying to find an anti-gravity machine.
与此同时，菲利斯正试图找一台反重力机器。

674
00:28:39.530 --> 00:28:43.930
So far, she's only found someone who can connect her to antidepressants.
到目前为止，她只找到了一个能帮她联系到抗抑郁药的人。

675
00:28:44.790 --> 00:28:48.230
I'm telling you, I have a catch at 7 minutes, 39 seconds.
我跟你说，我在7分39秒处发现了一个笑点。

676
00:28:48.450 --> 00:28:52.670
Phyllis is about to break when the lady on the phone says antidepressants.
当电话那头的女士提到抗抑郁药时，菲利斯快要破功了。

677
00:28:52.770 --> 00:28:54.470
You can see her starting to laugh.
你可以看到她开始笑了。

678
00:28:54.690 --> 00:29:01.870
We had a fan question about this, Angela, from Haley S, Corinne T, Rose P, and Joe S.
安吉拉，我们收到一个关于此的粉丝提问，来自海莉·S、科琳·T、罗斯·P和乔·S。

679
00:29:01.870 --> 00:29:06.630
They said, who is she talking to on the phone?
他们问，她在电话里是在和谁说话？

680
00:29:06.850 --> 00:29:10.330
Because many of them think it sounds like Amy Ryan.
因为他们很多人觉得听起来像艾米·瑞恩。

681
00:29:10.730 --> 00:29:14.570
They were like, did Amy Ryan fill in as the woman on the phone?
他们问，艾米·瑞恩是不是客串了电话里的那个女人？

682
00:29:15.130 --> 00:29:16.450
No, she did not.
不，她没有。

683
00:29:16.610 --> 00:29:18.590
I asked Kentopedia about this.
我问过肯托百科关于这件事的情况。

684
00:29:18.730 --> 00:29:23.210
He said that we auditioned seven women to do this voiceover.
他说我们当时试镜了七位女性来录这段旁白。

685
00:29:23.410 --> 00:29:26.890
He's pretty sure that we went with actress Molly Hagan.
他很确定我们最终选用了演员莫莉·哈根。

686
00:29:26.890 --> 00:29:33.010
I could not find this part credited anywhere online, but I will tell you, if you saw Molly
我在网上任何地方都找不到这个角色的演职员表，但我可以告诉你，如果你看到莫莉·

687
00:29:33.010 --> 00:29:34.390
Hagan, you would recognize her.
哈根，你一定会认出她来。

688
00:29:34.550 --> 00:29:36.810
She's this brilliant, comedic actress.
她是一位才华横溢的喜剧演员。

689
00:29:37.090 --> 00:29:39.830
I'd also like to point out, she's been on Monk.
我还想指出，她演过《神探阿蒙》。

690
00:29:40.050 --> 00:29:41.130
Oh, no way.
哦，不会吧。

691
00:29:41.590 --> 00:29:41.910
Yeah.
是的。

692
00:29:42.310 --> 00:29:46.490
I mean, Molly Hagan is like such a fantastic character actress.
我是说，莫莉·哈根是一位非常出色的性格演员。

693
00:29:46.790 --> 00:29:48.550
Like, if we got her, we were so lucky.
如果能请到她，我们真是太幸运了。

694
00:29:48.890 --> 00:29:49.490
I know.
我知道。

695
00:29:49.970 --> 00:29:54.790
Folks out there listening, I want you to know there are many, many more delicious
各位听众，我想让你们知道，还有很多很多精彩的

696
00:29:55.490 --> 00:29:58.530
deleted Phyllis scenes as she tries to plan this party.
菲利斯被删减的片段，关于她试图筹划这场派对。

697
00:29:59.030 --> 00:30:02.490
So many, but I would like to play one of my favorites for you now.
非常多，但我现在想为你们播放其中我最喜欢的一段。

698
00:30:02.650 --> 00:30:03.850
It's from the DVD.
它来自DVD。

699
00:30:04.250 --> 00:30:05.990
It's a scene between Kevin and Phyllis.
这是凯文和菲利斯之间的一场戏。

700
00:30:06.130 --> 00:30:09.450
And then, of course, a little bit of Angela sass at the end.
当然，最后还有一点安吉拉式的毒舌。

701
00:30:11.430 --> 00:30:11.910
Yes.
是的。

702
00:30:12.330 --> 00:30:13.290
Good news, Phil.
好消息，菲利斯。

703
00:30:13.770 --> 00:30:16.030
The band just had a last minute cancellation.
乐队刚才临时取消了演出。

704
00:30:16.650 --> 00:30:20.110
So we are available to play at the going away party tonight.
所以我们今晚有空去欢送会上表演了。

705
00:30:20.810 --> 00:30:21.510
No way.
没门。

706
00:30:21.790 --> 00:30:23.390
After what you guys did at my wedding?
在你们在我婚礼上搞出那种事之后？

707
00:30:23.390 --> 00:30:24.650
That wasn't me, Phyllis.
那不是我干的，菲利斯。

708
00:30:24.770 --> 00:30:26.430
That was Chester on bass.
那是切斯特弹的贝斯。

709
00:30:26.650 --> 00:30:29.470
I'm talking about 30 police songs in a row.
我说的是连续唱了30首警察乐队的歌。

710
00:30:29.750 --> 00:30:31.310
All off-key, off-temple.
全都不在调上，节奏也乱七八糟。

711
00:30:31.430 --> 00:30:34.070
And you forgot at least half the lyrics.
而且你们至少忘了一半的歌词。

712
00:30:34.430 --> 00:30:36.870
But, Phyllis, that was Scrantonicity.
但是，菲利斯，那是“斯克兰顿之音”乐队。

713
00:30:37.490 --> 00:30:38.050
Today it worked.
今天情况不一样了。

714
00:30:39.050 --> 00:30:42.190
Now, I am with Scrantonicity, too.
现在，我也加入了“斯克兰顿之音”。

715
00:30:42.670 --> 00:30:44.490
Give me a break.
饶了我吧。

716
00:30:45.250 --> 00:30:46.390
Fine, Phyllis.
好吧，菲利斯。

717
00:30:47.070 --> 00:30:49.210
I'm sorry that I ruined your wedding.
很抱歉我搞砸了你的婚礼。

718
00:30:49.210 --> 00:30:52.370
I didn't mean Kev.
我不是那个意思，凯文。

719
00:30:52.690 --> 00:30:53.410
Kevin.
凯文。

720
00:30:54.410 --> 00:30:55.670
Nice job.
干得漂亮。

721
00:30:56.150 --> 00:30:56.790
Real nice.
真是太棒了。

722
00:30:57.870 --> 00:30:58.970
Thank you.
谢谢。

723
00:30:59.390 --> 00:31:00.950
I didn't mean it.
我不是那个意思。

724
00:31:01.450 --> 00:31:01.690
Really?
真的吗？

725
00:31:01.910 --> 00:31:02.910
You didn't mean it?
你不是那个意思？

726
00:31:03.870 --> 00:31:04.750
Oh, my God.
天哪。

727
00:31:04.990 --> 00:31:07.190
So many great details about Phyllis's wedding.
关于菲利斯婚礼的细节真是太多了。

728
00:31:08.430 --> 00:31:10.530
30 police songs in a row.
连续30首警察乐队的歌。

729
00:31:11.370 --> 00:31:13.030
Off-key, off-tempo.
走调，节奏不对。

730
00:31:13.150 --> 00:31:14.530
They didn't know all the words.
他们连歌词都没记全。

731
00:31:14.710 --> 00:31:15.530
That would be horrible.
那简直太可怕了。

732
00:31:16.110 --> 00:31:17.130
Oh, my gosh.
天呐。

733
00:31:17.290 --> 00:31:19.290
And then I pop in at the end.
然后我在最后突然冒了出来。

734
00:31:19.510 --> 00:31:21.690
And, Jenna, for this scene, I remember filming it.
而且，珍娜，这一幕我记得当时拍摄的情景。

735
00:31:21.750 --> 00:31:24.670
Because I'm supposed to walk into the conference room like I overheard.
因为我得装作无意中听到一样走进会议室。

736
00:31:24.790 --> 00:31:25.570
Like, way to go.
就像是，干得好啊。

737
00:31:25.990 --> 00:31:27.110
But they couldn't hide my belly.
但他们没法遮住我的肚子。

738
00:31:27.290 --> 00:31:33.330
So they had me snuggle up to the wall and then lean, like, lean my head around the corner.
所以他们让我紧贴着墙，然后探身，就像是把头从拐角处探出来一样。

739
00:31:33.490 --> 00:31:34.510
It was so awkward.
那真是太尴尬了。

740
00:31:34.730 --> 00:31:37.370
And on set that day was an NBC photographer.
那天片场还有一位NBC的摄影师。

741
00:31:37.630 --> 00:31:39.490
And he was in the conference room.
他当时就在会议室里。

742
00:31:39.510 --> 00:31:43.010
And he took this picture of me leaning around the corner.
他拍下了我从拐角探出头的那张照片。

743
00:31:43.250 --> 00:31:46.410
And, lady, it's the photo they used on so many things.
天哪，那张照片后来被用在好多地方。

744
00:31:46.430 --> 00:31:47.970
And I'm so clearly pregnant.
而且我当时明显怀孕了。

745
00:31:47.990 --> 00:31:49.170
I'm like, this photo?
我心想，就这张照片？

746
00:31:49.410 --> 00:31:51.910
This is the day you're going to take my picture?
这就是你决定要拍我的那一天？

747
00:31:53.130 --> 00:31:54.410
I'm going to put it in stories.
我得把这事写进故事里。

748
00:31:54.410 --> 00:31:55.330
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

749
00:31:55.410 --> 00:31:56.730
Whenever I see it, I'm like, really?
每次看到那张照片，我都会想，真的吗？

750
00:31:57.130 --> 00:31:58.390
There's no other photo?
就没别的照片了吗？

751
00:31:58.570 --> 00:31:59.330
This was the photo.
这就是那张照片。

752
00:31:59.530 --> 00:32:00.590
This will live forever.
这将会永存。

753
00:32:01.250 --> 00:32:01.730
Great.
太棒了。

754
00:32:02.090 --> 00:32:02.390
Fantastic.
好极了。

755
00:32:02.990 --> 00:32:03.390
Thank you.
谢谢。

756
00:32:04.610 --> 00:32:08.110
Well, now Toby is going to bring Holly to meet Michael.
好了，现在托比要带霍莉去见迈克尔了。

757
00:32:08.710 --> 00:32:11.210
Michael is so annoyed.
迈克尔非常恼火。

758
00:32:12.330 --> 00:32:12.810
Yeah.
是啊。

759
00:32:13.130 --> 00:32:15.250
Now he's got to deal with female Toby.
现在他得应付女版托比了。

760
00:32:15.450 --> 00:32:19.050
He says, listen, my job is to make the office fun.
他说，听着，我的工作是让办公室变得有趣。

761
00:32:19.210 --> 00:32:21.230
Your job is to make the office lame.
你的工作是让办公室变得无聊。

762
00:32:21.450 --> 00:32:22.890
Only one of us can win.
我们之间只能有一个赢家。

763
00:32:22.890 --> 00:32:25.950
And he's basically like, newsflash, it's going to be me.
他基本上就是那种态度，嘿，醒醒吧，赢的一定是我。

764
00:32:26.710 --> 00:32:30.630
And then Holly throws him a total curveball.
然后霍莉给了他一个完全意想不到的反应。

765
00:32:30.930 --> 00:32:33.590
She turns to Toby and is like, what did you do to him?
她转向托比说，你对他做了什么？

766
00:32:33.770 --> 00:32:34.710
And Toby's like, nothing.
托比说，没做什么。

767
00:32:34.990 --> 00:32:37.570
And Michael's like, no, he tortured me with his awfulness.
迈克尔说，不，他用他的糟糕透顶折磨我。

768
00:32:37.710 --> 00:32:40.130
And then Holly's like, yeah, I know what you mean.
然后霍莉说，是啊，我懂你的意思。

769
00:32:40.290 --> 00:32:43.050
I nearly fell asleep when he gave me a tour of the files.
他带我参观档案室的时候，我差点睡着了。

770
00:32:43.570 --> 00:32:44.470
Michael is thrown.
迈克尔惊呆了。

771
00:32:44.690 --> 00:32:46.030
He has met his person.
他遇到了他的命中注定。

772
00:32:46.170 --> 00:32:46.630
I know.
我知道。

773
00:32:46.750 --> 00:32:47.530
And it's crazy.
这太疯狂了。

774
00:32:47.790 --> 00:32:48.750
It's two sentences.
就两句话。

775
00:32:48.750 --> 00:32:50.110
And he's in love.
他就坠入爱河了。

776
00:32:50.930 --> 00:32:54.230
All of a sudden, she is the most attractive, wonderful woman he's ever met.
突然之间，她成了他见过最迷人、最棒的女人。

777
00:32:54.430 --> 00:32:57.930
He has this great talking head where he says, you know what?
他有个很棒的单人采访，他说，你知道吗？

778
00:32:58.190 --> 00:33:03.090
Thanks to Toby, he believed that the HR department was a breeding ground for monsters.
多亏了托比，他一直以为人力资源部是怪物的温床。

779
00:33:03.310 --> 00:33:07.490
But what he failed to realize was that not all monsters are bad.
但他没意识到，并不是所有的怪物都是坏的。

780
00:33:07.670 --> 00:33:08.710
Like E.T.
就像E.T.一样。

781
00:33:09.190 --> 00:33:11.790
Is Holly their E.T.?
霍莉是他们的E.T.吗？

782
00:33:11.790 --> 00:33:12.490
Yeah.
是啊。

783
00:33:12.750 --> 00:33:14.190
Is Holly our extraterrestrial?
霍莉是我们的外星人吗？

784
00:33:14.410 --> 00:33:14.570
Yeah.
是啊。

785
00:33:15.330 --> 00:33:18.110
She's just an awesome woman from this planet.
她只是个来自这个星球的了不起的女人。

786
00:33:23.040 --> 00:33:23.440
Gosh.
天哪。

787
00:33:23.680 --> 00:33:25.780
Well, Holly is going to keep making the rounds.
好吧，霍莉还要继续转转。

788
00:33:26.020 --> 00:33:27.700
She's going to keep meeting people in the office.
她还要继续见办公室里的其他人。

789
00:33:27.860 --> 00:33:30.060
But before we do that, should we take a quick break?
但在那之前，我们要不要先休息一下？

790
00:33:31.000 --> 00:33:35.260
Yes, because I texted Creed about the moment that Creed meets Holly.
好的，因为我给克里德发了短信，问他见到霍莉那一刻的感觉。

791
00:33:35.460 --> 00:33:36.820
And I'll share that when we come back.
回来后我会分享给大家。

792
00:33:36.840 --> 00:33:37.860
Yay, I love it.
耶，我太喜欢了。

793
00:33:48.460 --> 00:33:49.580
All right, we are back.
好了，我们回来了。

794
00:33:49.760 --> 00:33:54.960
There is a fantastic scene between Creed and Holly where Holly's like, hey, I look forward
克里德和霍莉之间有一场精彩的戏，霍莉说，嘿，我很期待

795
00:33:54.960 --> 00:33:58.060
to, you know, spending time with you and finding out what it is you do here.
和你相处，了解你在这里具体做什么。

796
00:34:00.320 --> 00:34:03.100
And Creed's little computer shuts down.
然后克里德的小电脑就死机了。

797
00:34:03.280 --> 00:34:04.340
His brain is like, oh, God.
他的大脑在说，噢，天哪。

798
00:34:04.520 --> 00:34:04.900
Oh, God.
噢，天哪。

799
00:34:05.220 --> 00:34:07.980
So I texted with Creed Bratton about this.
所以我为此和克里德·布拉顿发了短信。

800
00:34:08.080 --> 00:34:10.720
And he said he was so excited for the scene.
他说他非常期待这场戏。

801
00:34:10.760 --> 00:34:14.060
He knew it was definitely in his comedy wheelhouse.
他知道这绝对在他的喜剧舒适区内。

802
00:34:14.220 --> 00:34:21.020
And he said he purposely took an extra long beat after he shook hands with Holly and then
他说他故意在和霍莉握手后多停顿了一会儿，然后

803
00:34:21.020 --> 00:34:21.700
walked away.
走开了。

804
00:34:21.700 --> 00:34:23.720
He really wanted to drag out that moment.
他真的很想把那一刻拉长。

805
00:34:23.720 --> 00:34:27.820
I thought it was so great because then it cuts to him hiding behind the refrigerator
我觉得这太棒了，因为镜头随后切到他躲在冰箱后面，

806
00:34:27.820 --> 00:34:28.580
in the kitchen.
在厨房里。

807
00:34:28.880 --> 00:34:31.080
And he's like, what is wrong with this woman?
他当时心想，这个女人是怎么回事？

808
00:34:31.280 --> 00:34:33.680
She's asking about stuff that's nobody's business.
她问的都是些不关别人的事。

809
00:34:34.060 --> 00:34:35.060
What do I do here?
我该怎么办？

810
00:34:35.240 --> 00:34:38.980
Quah, quah, quah, quah, quibbity, quah, quibbity, quah, quibbity, quah assurance.
夸，夸，夸，夸，夸比蒂，夸，夸比蒂，夸，夸比蒂，夸质量保证。

811
00:34:39.520 --> 00:34:39.920
Yes.
是的。

812
00:34:40.140 --> 00:34:42.120
His job is quality assurance.
他的工作是质量保证。

813
00:34:42.840 --> 00:34:43.240
Yeah.
是啊。

814
00:34:43.620 --> 00:34:45.040
And he's like, no, no, no, no, no.
他当时心想，不，不，不，不，不。

815
00:34:45.160 --> 00:34:46.100
But I'm getting close.
但我快要猜到了。

816
00:34:46.460 --> 00:34:48.880
But I just thought Creed was so great in it.
但我只是觉得克里德在里面的表现太棒了。

817
00:34:49.700 --> 00:34:54.400
Well, Dwight is going to ask Holly if she has met Kevin yet.
嗯，德怀特打算问霍莉是否已经见过凯文了。

818
00:34:54.680 --> 00:35:01.220
And as part of his hazing, he is going to tell her that Kevin is here as part of a special
作为捉弄她的一部分，他打算告诉她，凯文是作为一个特殊

819
00:35:01.220 --> 00:35:03.180
work program because he is slow.
工作项目的一员在这里，因为他反应迟钝。

820
00:35:03.720 --> 00:35:07.060
She goes up to Kevin and she really goes out of her way.
她走到凯文面前，真的对他格外关照。

821
00:35:07.300 --> 00:35:09.720
And he offers her some M&Ms.
他还请她吃了一些M&M豆。

822
00:35:10.300 --> 00:35:14.880
And Kevin is delighted that anyone is taking an interest in him, right?
凯文很高兴有人对他感兴趣，对吧？

823
00:35:15.040 --> 00:35:17.500
Because all Angela ever does is say, shut up, Kevin.
因为安吉拉只会对他说，闭嘴，凯文。

824
00:35:17.500 --> 00:35:19.780
And I don't think Oscar talks to Kevin much.
而且我觉得奥斯卡也不怎么跟凯文说话。

825
00:35:19.920 --> 00:35:21.580
He's stuck back there in that corner.
他被困在那个角落里。

826
00:35:21.960 --> 00:35:23.380
He can't believe it.
他简直不敢相信。

827
00:35:23.560 --> 00:35:25.040
Someone cares about his M&Ms.
竟然有人关心他的M&M豆。

828
00:35:25.300 --> 00:35:30.680
I thought the way Amy Ryan as Holly did all of her scenes was brilliant.
我觉得艾米·莱恩饰演的霍莉在所有场景中的表现都非常出色。

829
00:35:31.100 --> 00:35:37.700
Well, Michael is going to come over and he starts flirting with Holly.
嗯，迈克尔走过来开始和霍莉调情。

830
00:35:38.600 --> 00:35:39.940
They are the worSt.
他们真是太糟糕了。

831
00:35:40.140 --> 00:35:43.000
He says, if we hung you up, we'd have to kiss under you.
他说，如果我们把你挂起来，我们就得在你下面接吻。

832
00:35:43.220 --> 00:35:44.700
He means mistletoe.
他的意思是槲寄生。

833
00:35:45.800 --> 00:35:47.920
And then he calls her a hologram.
然后他称她为全息图。

834
00:35:48.140 --> 00:35:51.140
Then he says, and this sounds like something I would say.
接着他说，这听起来像是我会说的话。

835
00:35:51.340 --> 00:35:54.100
He says, are these guys boring your ears off?
他说，这些人是不是把你的耳朵都说烦了？

836
00:35:54.260 --> 00:35:55.980
What would you say besides that?
除了这个你还会说什么？

837
00:35:57.040 --> 00:35:59.980
I think you say, are they talking, chatting your ear off?
我想你会说，他们是不是在跟你闲聊，说得你耳朵都起茧了？

838
00:36:00.420 --> 00:36:02.220
Not boring your ears off.
而不是把你的耳朵说烦了。

839
00:36:02.380 --> 00:36:03.380
That's not a saying.
那不是一句俗语。

840
00:36:03.540 --> 00:36:04.480
No one says that.
没人会那么说。

841
00:36:04.740 --> 00:36:05.740
Oh my gosh.
天哪。

842
00:36:05.740 --> 00:36:12.080
I love that you are the person who is like, nobody's just boring your ears off when it's
我喜欢你这种人，明明是你自己完全会说的话，却说没人会说“把耳朵说烦了”这种话。

843
00:36:12.080 --> 00:36:13.780
something you would totally say.
这确实是你完全会说的话。

844
00:36:14.200 --> 00:36:15.140
I know.
我知道。

845
00:36:15.280 --> 00:36:16.860
But Michael is flustered.
但迈克尔当时心慌意乱。

846
00:36:16.860 --> 00:36:19.720
And then, oh my gosh, you just start speeding ahead.
然后，天哪，你开始加速了。

847
00:36:19.720 --> 00:36:21.220
He's like, I'll make you a mix CD.
他说，我给你做一张混合CD。

848
00:36:21.620 --> 00:36:22.560
What's your commute like?
你通勤要多久？

849
00:36:22.700 --> 00:36:24.040
Oh my gosh, Michael, slow down.
天哪，迈克尔，慢点。

850
00:36:24.160 --> 00:36:28.000
Meanwhile, at reception, Pam gives Toby a going away present.
与此同时，在前台，帕姆给了托比一份临别礼物。

851
00:36:28.340 --> 00:36:31.320
It's a photo of everyone in the office.
这是办公室所有人的合影。

852
00:36:31.320 --> 00:36:33.660
And he can take it with him to Costa Rica.
他可以带去哥斯达黎加。

853
00:36:33.960 --> 00:36:35.000
Isn't that so nice?
这不是很棒吗？

854
00:36:35.680 --> 00:36:36.500
So nice.
太棒了。

855
00:36:36.720 --> 00:36:38.060
Jenna, I found this photo.
珍娜，我找到了这张照片。

856
00:36:38.320 --> 00:36:38.880
I have it.
我有这张照片。

857
00:36:39.000 --> 00:36:39.420
You do?
你有？

858
00:36:40.000 --> 00:36:41.940
Yeah, they gave it to all of us.
对，他们给了我们每个人一张。

859
00:36:42.040 --> 00:36:43.160
But I'm not in it.
但我不在照片里。

860
00:36:44.000 --> 00:36:45.160
You took it.
是你拍的。

861
00:36:45.500 --> 00:36:45.980
Exactly.
没错。

862
00:36:46.300 --> 00:36:48.980
So yeah, I guess you didn't get it, but I have it.
所以，我想你没拿到，但我有。

863
00:36:49.060 --> 00:36:49.560
Oh my gosh.
天哪。

864
00:36:50.220 --> 00:36:55.660
Everyone is facing forward except for a small blonde accountant who's facing sideways
每个人都面向镜头，除了一个侧着身子的小个子金发会计，

865
00:36:55.660 --> 00:36:56.760
tucked behind people.
躲在别人后面。

866
00:36:56.920 --> 00:36:57.340
Why?
为什么？

867
00:36:57.460 --> 00:36:59.120
I wonder why she's facing sideways.
我很好奇她为什么要侧着身子。

868
00:36:59.340 --> 00:37:01.100
Oh my gosh, that is so funny.
天哪，这太搞笑了。

869
00:37:02.080 --> 00:37:04.400
Yes, Jenna, they took this on set one day.
是的，珍娜，他们有一天在片场拍的。

870
00:37:04.500 --> 00:37:07.160
We had to do that thing where we had to be in different wardrobe.
我们当时得拍那个换不同服装的戏份。

871
00:37:07.420 --> 00:37:08.280
You know what I mean?
你知道我的意思吗？

872
00:37:08.660 --> 00:37:11.860
And we took this picture in between scenes one afternoon.
那天下午我们在拍摄间隙拍了这张照片。

873
00:37:12.000 --> 00:37:12.500
That's amazing.
太神奇了。

874
00:37:12.960 --> 00:37:15.640
Well, I'm not in it because I was taking it.
嗯，我不在照片里是因为我在拍照。

875
00:37:16.040 --> 00:37:17.100
Toby's very sad.
托比非常难过。

876
00:37:17.440 --> 00:37:20.080
And he's like, well, I love it.
他说，嗯，我很喜欢这张照片。

877
00:37:20.560 --> 00:37:23.760
But maybe I could get a picture of just the two of us.
但或许我能和你单独拍一张？

878
00:37:24.040 --> 00:37:25.480
And Pam's like, sure.
帕姆说，当然可以。

879
00:37:25.640 --> 00:37:26.400
Do you have a camera?
你有相机吗？

880
00:37:27.000 --> 00:37:31.040
And then Toby like screams out.
然后托比大喊起来。

881
00:37:31.400 --> 00:37:33.240
Does anyone have a camera?
有人有相机吗？

882
00:37:35.630 --> 00:37:36.750
So good.
太精彩了。

883
00:37:36.750 --> 00:37:38.770
I laughed so hard at that, Jenna.
我当时笑得好大声，珍娜。

884
00:37:38.970 --> 00:37:41.190
We had a fan question from Mariah A.
我们收到一个来自玛丽亚·A的粉丝提问。

885
00:37:41.610 --> 00:37:44.350
When Toby yells, does anyone have a camera?
当托比大喊“有人有相机吗？”时，

886
00:37:44.590 --> 00:37:45.770
Was that scripted?
那是剧本写的吗？

887
00:37:45.970 --> 00:37:47.610
Angela, can you check the script?
安吉拉，你能查一下剧本吗？

888
00:37:48.650 --> 00:37:49.170
Yes.
好的。

889
00:37:49.470 --> 00:37:49.610
Yes.
好的。

890
00:37:49.610 --> 00:37:49.750
Okay.
好的。

891
00:37:50.050 --> 00:37:51.430
So it is in the script.
所以这确实在剧本里。

892
00:37:51.650 --> 00:37:53.330
It's written slightly different in the script.
剧本里写的稍微有点不同。

893
00:37:53.530 --> 00:37:56.150
It says that Pam says, do you have your camera here?
上面写着帕姆问，你带相机了吗？

894
00:37:56.350 --> 00:38:01.310
And Toby, louder than he's ever been, yells, who has a camera?
然后托比用他有史以来最大的音量大喊，谁有相机？

895
00:38:01.770 --> 00:38:02.870
Nobody answers.
没人回答。

896
00:38:03.110 --> 00:38:04.890
And Toby says, I'll go get one.
然后托比说，我去拿一个。

897
00:38:06.110 --> 00:38:07.630
So it is very similar.
所以非常相似。

898
00:38:07.670 --> 00:38:09.070
And it was in the script.
而且这确实在剧本里。

899
00:38:09.310 --> 00:38:10.130
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

900
00:38:10.230 --> 00:38:10.990
It was so funny.
太搞笑了。

901
00:38:11.210 --> 00:38:17.190
I was thinking at this point in the story, remember, Ryan gave us all BlackBerrys.
我当时在想，故事讲到这儿，记得吗，瑞安给了我们每人一部黑莓手机。

902
00:38:17.330 --> 00:38:19.410
There's a camera on your BlackBerry.
你的黑莓手机上有摄像头。

903
00:38:19.730 --> 00:38:21.570
I guess that won't do for Toby.
我想这对托比来说还不够。

904
00:38:21.750 --> 00:38:22.850
He wants a proper photo.
他想要一张正儿八经的照片。

905
00:38:23.630 --> 00:38:25.690
I think he wants a real deal picture.
我觉得他想要一张真正的照片。

906
00:38:25.990 --> 00:38:28.410
Well, next up, Jim's talking to Ryan on the phone.
好了，接下来，吉姆在电话里和瑞安通话。

907
00:38:28.570 --> 00:38:30.710
He's kind of bragging that he made a big sale.
他有点在吹嘘自己做成了一笔大生意。

908
00:38:31.310 --> 00:38:32.350
Ryan is not impressed.
瑞安却不以为然。

909
00:38:32.350 --> 00:38:34.990
He's like, oh, congratulations, you did your job.
他就像是说，哦，恭喜你，你完成了你的工作。

910
00:38:35.610 --> 00:38:38.770
Not only that, he says to Jim, don't interrupt.
不仅如此，他还对吉姆说，别打断我。

911
00:38:39.310 --> 00:38:42.230
I mean, the Ryan sass is strong.
我是说，瑞安的傲慢劲儿真强。

912
00:38:43.490 --> 00:38:44.010
Yeah.
是啊。

913
00:38:44.350 --> 00:38:47.150
He tells Jim, did you log it in the website yet?
他问吉姆，你把这笔订单录入网站了吗？

914
00:38:47.590 --> 00:38:48.810
Log it in the website.
录入网站。

915
00:38:49.290 --> 00:38:51.850
Jim's like, well, I already entered it as a sale.
吉姆说，好吧，我已经把它作为销售额录进去了。

916
00:38:51.950 --> 00:38:52.870
He's like, I don't care.
他却说，我不在乎。

917
00:38:53.330 --> 00:38:54.630
Log it in the website.
录入网站。

918
00:38:55.410 --> 00:38:55.790
Ooh.
噢。

919
00:38:56.430 --> 00:38:56.870
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

920
00:38:58.070 --> 00:38:59.110
Ryan sass.
瑞安的傲慢。

921
00:38:59.450 --> 00:39:02.190
Can we now talk about my favorite scene of this episode?
我们现在能聊聊我这集里最喜欢的场景了吗？

922
00:39:03.090 --> 00:39:04.370
Which one is it?
是哪一个？

923
00:39:04.490 --> 00:39:10.570
Michael in his office downloading the N3P music for his CD mixtape for Holly.
迈克尔在办公室里为霍莉下载N3P音乐，制作CD混音带。

924
00:39:11.210 --> 00:39:13.610
That whole couplet wasn't in the script.
那整段台词剧本里都没有。

925
00:39:14.030 --> 00:39:14.250
What?
什么？

926
00:39:14.850 --> 00:39:15.290
Yeah.
是啊。

927
00:39:15.470 --> 00:39:19.130
The N3P and the CD mixtape, that wasn't in the script.
N3P和CD混音带，那不在剧本里。

928
00:39:19.130 --> 00:39:20.770
But the rest of the scene was.
但场景的其他部分是在的。

929
00:39:20.950 --> 00:39:25.810
But just that language, which I have to think was either an alt or an ad lib.
但就那种说法，我得认为要么是备选台词，要么是即兴发挥。

930
00:39:25.910 --> 00:39:26.450
I don't know.
我不知道。

931
00:39:26.450 --> 00:39:27.950
Oh, I love it so much.
噢，我太喜欢这一段了。

932
00:39:28.110 --> 00:39:33.410
And I love Jim's response, where he's like, close, not quite.
而且我喜欢吉姆的回应，他说，接近了，但还没完全对。

933
00:39:34.250 --> 00:39:34.430
Yeah.
是啊。

934
00:39:34.590 --> 00:39:34.750
No.
不对。

935
00:39:35.550 --> 00:39:37.270
Michael is asking Jim's advice.
迈克尔在征求吉姆的建议。

936
00:39:37.530 --> 00:39:42.850
He needs to know what songs he should pick that work on two levels.
他需要知道该选哪些歌，才能达到双重效果。

937
00:39:43.310 --> 00:39:44.910
And here are the two levels.
这就是那双重效果。

938
00:39:45.410 --> 00:39:46.590
Welcome to Scranton.
欢迎来到斯克兰顿。

939
00:39:47.230 --> 00:39:48.310
And I love you.
还有我爱你。

940
00:39:49.550 --> 00:39:49.850
Yeah.
是啊。

941
00:39:50.090 --> 00:39:52.870
And he fell in love with her when he first heard her voice.
而且他第一次听到她的声音时就爱上她了。

942
00:39:53.110 --> 00:39:56.570
It was love at first sea with my ears.
那是我的耳朵对她的一见钟情。

943
00:39:56.770 --> 00:39:59.270
Jim is going to try to get Michael to pump the brakes.
吉姆打算让迈克尔冷静一下。

944
00:39:59.810 --> 00:40:00.270
Okay.
好的。

945
00:40:00.270 --> 00:40:05.450
And he says, you know, I maybe have a little bit of experience with office romance.
他说，你知道，我在办公室恋情方面可能有一点点经验。

946
00:40:05.790 --> 00:40:07.470
And Michael is like, who?
迈克尔就问，谁？

947
00:40:08.090 --> 00:40:08.690
Pam?
帕姆？

948
00:40:08.870 --> 00:40:10.130
That's still going on?
他们还在交往吗？

949
00:40:10.410 --> 00:40:15.530
I love this running joke that Michael is still surprised that they're dating.
我喜欢这个反复出现的梗，迈克尔对他们还在交往这件事总是感到惊讶。

950
00:40:15.890 --> 00:40:16.630
I know.
我知道。

951
00:40:16.890 --> 00:40:17.930
It's so good.
这太棒了。

952
00:40:18.510 --> 00:40:25.410
Well, he really tries to explain to Michael, you can have this romance, but you just have
嗯，他真的试着向迈克尔解释，你可以拥有这段恋情，但你只需要

953
00:40:25.410 --> 00:40:26.170
to take it slow.
慢慢来。

954
00:40:26.170 --> 00:40:27.130
Let it build.
顺其自然。

955
00:40:27.790 --> 00:40:30.750
Basically, he's saying, don't be a weirdo, Michael.
基本上，他是在说，别做个怪人，迈克尔。

956
00:40:31.250 --> 00:40:32.950
Don't be Michael, Michael.
别做那个迈克尔，迈克尔。

957
00:40:33.130 --> 00:40:33.330
Yeah.
没错。

958
00:40:33.930 --> 00:40:35.750
Take a new approach on this one.
这次换个新方法吧。

959
